[statement]
Reduced from a layered request over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`,
2026-11-11): `nitrokey-app2`'s closure from v3.23 installed and asked at a
later version. Nothing installed is in the world. `py3-pyocd` needs
`py3-cmsis-pack-manager`, `py3-colorama` and `py3-yaml`, and
`py3-cmsis-pack-manager` needs `py3-yaml` too. apk removes `py3-pyocd`,
`py3-cmsis-pack-manager`, `py3-colorama` and then `py3-yaml`: `py3-yaml`,
freed by `py3-cmsis-pack-manager`, does not follow it at once, since
`py3-pyocd` needs it after `py3-colorama`
(`installed/a-package-two-removals-free-goes-after-the-first-one-s-other-needs`).

[repository]
P:nitrokey-app2
V:2.5.2-r1

[installed]
P:py3-yaml
V:6.0.3-r0

P:py3-cmsis-pack-manager
V:0.6.0-r0
D:py3-yaml

P:py3-colorama
V:0.4.6-r6

P:py3-pyocd
V:0.41.0-r0
D:py3-cmsis-pack-manager py3-colorama py3-yaml

[request]
nitrokey-app2>2.4.1-r1

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove py3-pyocd 0.41.0-r0
remove py3-cmsis-pack-manager 0.6.0-r0
remove py3-colorama 0.4.6-r6
remove py3-yaml 6.0.3-r0
install nitrokey-app2 2.5.2-r1
